# 26 settembre 2026 — SCRATCH DELLA NOTTE, NON ANCORA VERDE (handoff in docs/plans/live-teaching.md):
# le lezioni con «repeat …» vengono rubate dallo smalltalk, il budget di iterate non arriva al report.
# Non e' nella suite: si lancia a mano con ./bin/parrot0 --test dopo make test-engine.
[mock live]
!set PARROT0_BASE=kb/core/base.p0
!set PARROT0_SESSION=
!set PARROT0_LANG=en
!reset

[test vecchie procedure di testo]
!timeout 5
> apply devowel to parrot
< devowel(«prrt») — that is what the steps give.
> apply shout to parrot
< shout(«PARROT») — that is what the steps give.
> apply squash to baaad
< squash(«bad») — that is what the steps give.

[test lezione e calcolo]
!timeout 5
> rule for vowels is keep vowel
< Held: for vowels, 1 is «keep vowel».
> apply vowels to parrot
< vowels(«ao») — that is what the steps give.
> rule for howmany is apply vowels
< Held: for howmany, 1 is «apply vowels».
!query proc_run(vowels, parrot, ao)
!query proc_run(howmany, parrot, ao)
> rule for howmany is count
> apply howmany to parrot
< howmany(«2») — that is what the steps give.
> rule for collatz_step is if even then halve else triple and add 1
< Held: for collatz_step, 1 is «if even then halve else triple and add 1».
> apply collatz_step to 6
< collatz_step(«3») — that is what the steps give.
> apply collatz_step to 3
< collatz_step(«10») — that is what the steps give.
> rule for collatz is repeat apply collatz_step until it reaches 1
< Held: for collatz, 1 is «repeat apply collatz_step until it reaches 1».
> apply collatz to 6
< collatz(«1») — that is what the steps give.
> apply collatz to 27
< collatz(«1») — that is what the steps give.
> rule for forever is repeat add 1 until below 0
< Held: for forever, 1 is «repeat add 1 until below 0».
> apply forever to 5
<~ did not finish
> rule for bogus is frobnicate the value
<~ I cannot run «frobnicate the value» as a step of bogus
